# [IMPL-TCP_CONNECT_REPORT] [ARCH-TCP_CONNECT_CHECKER] [REQ-TCP_CONNECT_CHECKER]

Column-aligned human-readable report lines.


Grammar-Version: v2

## FORMAT_LINES

<!-- [IMPL-TCP_CONNECT_REPORT] [ARCH-TCP_CONNECT_CHECKER] [REQ-TCP_CONNECT_CHECKER]: formats probe results into aligned stdout lines with ms elapsed for every status -->

Contract:
  INPUT: results slice with one entry per target
  OUTPUT: one line per result; stable column alignment across batch
  PRE: results slice with one entry per target
  POST: one line per result; stable column alignment across batch
  EFFECTS: computes max address width; pads status to 7 chars; prints elapsed integer ms for all statuses including TIMEOUT
  TERMINATION: total

procedure FORMAT_LINES(): # [IMPL-TCP_CONNECT_REPORT] [ARCH-TCP_CONNECT_CHECKER] [REQ-TCP_CONNECT_CHECKER]
1. maxAddr := max length of result.Address in results
2. FOR each result IN results format line with padded address, status, and ms
3. RETURN joined lines with newline
